{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：23:13 2026-11-04 HKT<br/>發佈時間：23:13 2026-11-04 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：23:13 2026-11-04 HKT</p><img alt=\"「加州本事」潘頓中三元\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/66dddc384d05e4847edcdca344229b4a/2026-11/r9_0.jpg\"/><p>今晚快活谷尾場三班千二米，「加州本事」強配潘頓，起步後貼欄領放，入直路一度抛離對手，即使大熱門「長勝隊馬」後追甚勁亦只能屈居第二。</p><p>潘頓以四十六分成為騎師王冠軍，告東尼則以三十分成為練馬師王冠軍。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T15:26:36.996575+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T15:13:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T15:19:31.998557+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T15:19:31.998557+00:00","content_hash":"bed3e61e92977f722cbbc9e38d029678405f14bb9b4c012bc46489f1cad57de1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}